      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OUTAKANDY (3) is the one to beat after a sharp third-up pointer at Beaudesert, where he was third in a CL4 over 1200m and beaten just over half a length despite jumping awkwardly. He has winning form around 1400m, gets weight relief and has the winning rider back, so the profile is solid. NIGHTCAPPED (4) is the main danger. Was less effective last time at the Sunny Coast, but she was only beaten a lip there the start prior. BATTLETON (1) drops back from Saturday company after a plain effort at Doomben, with his close fifth two back keeping him in the minor-money mix. ARATIRI (5) has been patchy of late but boasts strong peaks down at this weight. Backs up quickly and is in the mix. LIBERTY STEPS (2) never ever looked likely last time on the Birdsville dirt but his form prior was solid. Keeping safe in the placings back on the turf.",
